# Rauf runtime — deny-by-default (#195): the runner writes transient artifacts
# (.loop.lock, state.json, DONE, CANCEL, iteration-status.json, rauf.log,
# events.ndjson, progress.md, archive/, …) into .rauf/ at run time, and a
# future artifact must not be able to reopen the gap an itemized list leaves.
# Only the deliberately-authored files below are tracked. (`/*`, not `/`, so
# the negations can re-include — git cannot re-include under an excluded dir.)
**/.rauf/*
!**/.rauf/RAUF.md
!**/.rauf/REVIEW.md
!**/.rauf/backlog.json
!**/.rauf/backlog.schema.json
**/backlog.json.bak

# Local Claude Code session artifacts
.claude/

# Internal dev planning notes — not part of the public/published surface.
# The Copilot adaptation is an explicit cross-machine exception: its tracker,
# source plans, and sanitized evidence are required for multi-session continuity.
plans/*
!plans/copilot-adaptation/
!plans/copilot-adaptation/**

# Adapter build artefacts (forge-agent-adapters-build)
.venv-adapters/
adapters.tmp-*/

# Cross-agent installer (Node package)
installer/node_modules/
installer/dist/
installer/adapters/
installer/LICENSE

# Hand-written adapter sources (adapter-src/<agent>/): each agent dir carries its
# own verify toolchain. Deps are devDeps only — never shipped, never published.
adapter-src/*/node_modules/

__pycache__/
*.pyc

# pi subagent run artifacts (transcripts/meta from forge-verifier fan-outs)
.pi-subagents/
